   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f44bc5db",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# 图 2.1\n",
    "\n",
    "![2.1.png](attachment:2.1.png)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "eaefffab",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 背景信息"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "603e79f4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "插值曲线在图 2.1 中以绿色实线绘制.可以看到,符合插值函数的特性,曲线经过全部 10 个样本点;但不足之处在于,除区间中间区域外,该曲线对真实函数的近似效果很差.插值曲线在区间两端剧烈振荡,这是高次多项式插值中一种熟知的问题,称作 Runge 现象.右侧子图绘制了 10 个 Chebyshev 节点试验设计点及其对应的函数观测值.可以看出,相较于等距设计点,该组节点会更多地向区间两端靠拢.图中同样以绿色实线给出插值曲线,该曲线能够很好地近似真实函数,相比左侧子图中等距节点的插值结果有大幅改善.这个例子充分体现了试验设计的重要性!"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "35b097f5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\\quad\\boxed{\\sigma_{\\omega}\\sigma}\\quad\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "37cc0f1d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 指令"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9a544011",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "创建宽 10 英寸,高 5 英寸的画布,将画布分为 1x2:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f123feb6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "options(repr.plot.width=10, repr.plot.height=5)\n",
    "par(mfrow=c(1,2))\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "c31e30b6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "令函数"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f878bac4",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$f(x):=\\frac{\\sin(10\\pi x)}{1+64(x-.25)^{2}}+x^{2}:$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "edcaadb6",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "f=function(x) sin(10*pi*x)/(1+64*(x-.25)^2)+x^2\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "70db8094",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "在 $[0,1]$ 中创建 301 个点,并计算真实函数值:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "17a3179a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "test=seq(0,1,length=301)\n",
    "true=f(test)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "04d9502b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "1. 等距节点:做真实函数的图像,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 线条类型为平滑曲线;\n",
    "- $x$ 轴标注为 `x`,$y$ 轴标注为 `y`;\n",
    "- 线宽为 3;\n",
    "- 线条类型为虚线;\n",
    "- $y$ 轴显示范围为 $[\\min(y)-.25,\\max(y)+.25]$;\n",
    "- 主标题为"polynomial interpolation equi-spaced points":"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f00f1e6d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "plot(test,true,type=\"l\",xlab=\"x\",ylab=\"y\",lwd=3,lty=2,ylim=c(min(true)-.25,max(true)+.25),main=\"polynomial interpolation equi-spaced points\")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "b327e84d",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "在真实函数图像上水平间距均匀地取 10 个点,叠加在画布里,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 点的类型为实心圆点;\n",
    "- 缩放倍数为 2;\n",
    "- 颜色为蓝色:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "509b03f9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "n=10\n",
    "D=((1:n)-1)/(n-1)\n",
    "y=f(D)\n",
    "points(cbind(D,y),pch=16,cex=2,col=\"blue\")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "28530075",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "将 `D` 投影到 Chebyshev 多项式的定义域 $[-1,1]$ 上;创建空矩阵,利用公式 $R_{i}(x)=\\cos(i\\cos^{-1}(x))$,$i=0,\\dots,n-1$ 按列拼接成矩阵 $\\boldsymbol{R}$:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "88155168",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "d=2*D-1\n",
    "X=NULL\n",
    "for(i in 0:(n-1)) X=cbind(X,cos((i)*acos(d)))\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ede58b00",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "利用公式 $\\widehat{\\boldsymbol{\\beta}}=\\boldsymbol{R}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{y}$ 求解 $\\widehat{\\boldsymbol{\\beta}}$,将定义域放缩至 $[-1,1]$,创建空矩阵,利用公式 $R_{i}(x)=\\cos(i\\cos^{-1}(x))$,$i=0,\\dots,n-1$ 按列拼接成矩阵 $\\boldsymbol{r}(x)'$:利用公式 $\\widehat{y}(x)=\\boldsymbol{r}(x)'\\widehat{\\boldsymbol{\\beta}}$ 求解插值函数:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "5b4725e0",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "a=solve(X,y)\n",
    "us=2*test-1\n",
    "X_pred=NULL\n",
    "for(i in 0:(n-1)) X_pred=cbind(X_pred,cos((i)*acos(us)))\n",
    "yhat=X_pred%*%a\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "bdc056d3",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "叠加插值函数,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 颜色为绿色;\n",
    "- 线宽为 3:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "cc7e79a9",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "lines(test,yhat,col=3,lwd=3)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "51dcb5ba",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "叠加图例,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 位置在右下角;\n",
    "- 图例名为 `truth` 与 `prediction`;\n",
    "- 线型,颜色,线宽与二者分别对应;\n",
    "- 不画图例边框:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0a4eda96",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "legend(\"bottomright\",legend=c(\"truth\",\"prediction\"),lty=c(2,1),col=c(1,3),lwd=c(2,3),bty=\"n\")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f0e66f3b",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "2. Chebyshev 节点:做真实函数的图像,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 线条类型为平滑曲线;\n",
    "- $x$ 轴标注为 `x`,$y$ 轴标注为 `y`;\n",
    "- 线宽为 3;\n",
    "- 线条类型为虚线;\n",
    "- $y$ 轴显示范围为 $[\\min(y)-.25,\\max(y)+.25]$;\n",
    "- 主标题为"polynomial interpolation with Chebyshev nodes":"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "1dd28957",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "plot(test,true,type=\"l\",xlab=\"x\",ylab=\"y\",lwd=3,lty=2,col=1,ylim=c(min(true)-.25,max(true)+.25),main=\"polynomial interpolation with Chebyshev nodes\")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "9b5f3cac",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "依据公式 $x_{i}=\\cos(\\pi(i-.5)/n)$,$r=1,\\dots,n$ 计算出 Chebyshev 节点,放缩为 $[0,1]$ 上的点作为选取的节点,叠加在画布里,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 点的类型为实心圆点;\n",
    "- 缩放倍数为 2;\n",
    "- 颜色为蓝色:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "4691f0a5",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "d=cos(pi*((1:n)-.5)/n)\n",
    "D=(d+1)/2\n",
    "y=f(D)\n",
    "points(cbind(D,y),pch=16,cex=2,col=\"blue\")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "762696fb",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "创建空矩阵,利用公式 $R_{i}(x)=\\cos(i\\cos^{-1}(x))$,$i=0,\\dots,n-1$ 按列拼接成矩阵 $\\boldsymbol{R}$:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "24ab741a",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "X=NULL\n",
    "for(i in 0:(n-1)) X=cbind(X,cos((i)*acos(d)))\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "6a9e0d90",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "利用公式 $\\widehat{\\boldsymbol{\\beta}}=\\boldsymbol{R}^{-1}\\boldsymbol{y}$ 求解 $\\widehat{\\boldsymbol{\\beta}}$,将定义域放缩至 $[-1,1]$,创建空矩阵,利用公式 $R_{i}(x)=\\cos(i\\cos^{-1}(x))$,$i=0,\\dots,n-1$ 按列拼接成矩阵 $\\boldsymbol{r}(x)'$:利用公式 $\\widehat{y}(x)=\\boldsymbol{r}(x)'\\widehat{\\boldsymbol{\\beta}}$ 求解插值函数:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "35990acf",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "a=solve(X,y)\n",
    "us=2*test-1\n",
    "X_pred=NULL\n",
    "for(i in 0:(n-1)) X_pred=cbind(X_pred,cos((i)*acos(us)))\n",
    "yhat=X_pred%*%a\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "44b1f3ff",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "叠加插值函数,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 颜色为绿色;\n",
    "- 线宽为 3:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "a1c6ef86",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "lines(test,yhat,col=3,lwd=3)\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "e73492d1",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "叠加图例,其中:\n",
    "\n",
    "- 位置在右下角;\n",
    "- 图例名为 `truth` 与 `prediction`;\n",
    "- 线型,颜色,线宽与二者分别对应;\n",
    "- 不画图例边框:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "2c08cc06",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "legend(\"bottomright\",legend=c(\"truth\",\"prediction\"),lty=c(2,1),col=c(1,3),lwd=c(2,3),bty=\"n\")\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "f8d02f5c",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "将画布还原回 1x1:"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "56d5deb2",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "```r\n",
    "par(mfrow=c(1,1))\n",
    "```"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "ea46e4e8",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "$$\n",
    "\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\\quad\\boxed{\\sigma_{\\omega}\\sigma}\\quad\\bigstar\\;\\diamond\\;\\bigstar\n",
    "$$"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "10a2b138",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 最终效果"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "id": "a1757312",
   "metadata": {
    "vscode": {
     "languageId": "r"
    }
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": ".i.d.",
      "text/plain": [
       "Plot with title \"polynomial interpolation with Chebyshev nodes\""
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {
      "image/png": {
       "height": 300,
       "width": 600
      }
     },
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "# 图 2.1\n",
    "\n",
    "options(repr.plot.width=10, repr.plot.height=5)\n",
    "par(mfrow=c(1,2))\n",
    "f=function(x) sin(10*pi*x)/(1+64*(x-.25)^2)+x^2\n",
    "test=seq(0,1,length=301)\n",
    "true=f(test)\n",
    "\n",
    "## 等距点\n",
    "plot(test,true,type=\"l\",xlab=\"x\",ylab=\"y\",lwd=3,lty=2,ylim=c(min(true)-.25,max(true)+.25),main=\"polynomial interpolation equi-spaced points\")\n",
    "n=10\n",
    "D=((1:n)-1)/(n-1)\n",
    "y=f(D)\n",
    "points(cbind(D,y),pch=16,cex=2,col=\"blue\")\n",
    "d=2*D-1\n",
    "X=NULL\n",
    "for(i in 0:(n-1)) X=cbind(X,cos((i)*acos(d)))\n",
    "a=solve(X,y)\n",
    "us=2*test-1\n",
    "X_pred=NULL\n",
    "for(i in 0:(n-1)) X_pred=cbind(X_pred,cos((i)*acos(us)))\n",
    "yhat=X_pred%*%a\n",
    "lines(test,yhat,col=3,lwd=3)\n",
    "legend(\"bottomright\",legend=c(\"truth\",\"prediction\"),lty=c(2,1),col=c(1,3),lwd=c(2,3),bty=\"n\")\n",
    "\n",
    "# Chebyshev 节点\n",
    "plot(test,true,type=\"l\",xlab=\"x\",ylab=\"y\",lwd=3,lty=2,col=1,ylim=c(min(true)-.25,max(true)+.25),main=\"polynomial interpolation with Chebyshev nodes\")\n",
    "d=cos(pi*((1:n)-.5)/n)\n",
    "D=(d+1)/2\n",
    "y=f(D)\n",
    "points(cbind(D,y),pch=16,cex=2,col=\"blue\")\n",
    "X=NULL\n",
    "for(i in 0:(n-1)) X=cbind(X,cos((i)*acos(d)))\n",
    "a=solve(X,y)\n",
    "us=2*test-1\n",
    "X_pred=NULL\n",
    "for(i in 0:(n-1)) X_pred=cbind(X_pred,cos((i)*acos(us)))\n",
    "yhat=X_pred%*%a\n",
    "lines(test,yhat,col=3,lwd=3)\n",
    "legend(\"bottomright\",legend=c(\"truth\",\"prediction\"),lty=c(2,1),col=c(1,3),lwd=c(2,3),bty=\"n\")\n",
    "\n",
    "par(mfrow=c(1,1))"
   ]
  },
